1
00:00:06,680 --> 00:00:09,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Everyone's responsible
for copyright protection.]</font>

2
00:00:09,310 --> 00:00:14,020
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪After all the joy and sorrow♪</font>

3
00:00:14,540 --> 00:00:18,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪I still recall your face♪</font>

4
00:00:19,730 --> 00:00:25,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪You were by my side;
the cool rain fell♪</font>

5
00:00:25,380 --> 00:00:30,890
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪I closed my eyes
and heard you sing gently♪</font>

6
00:00:31,520 --> 00:00:36,170
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪I'd wager all
for a love that never ends♪</font>

7
00:00:37,150 --> 00:00:40,700
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪To keep you forever near♪</font>

8
00:00:42,020 --> 00:00:47,610
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪In this vast world,
I wait for your light♪</font>

9
00:00:47,740 --> 00:00:52,830
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪We'll share this dream
till dawn is bright♪</font>

10
00:00:53,220 --> 00:00:58,530
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪All the riddles of parting
I'll uncover♪</font>

11
00:00:58,840 --> 00:01:01,100
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪At last, I'll sing, kiss, and hold you♪</font>

12
00:01:01,100 --> 00:01:04,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪The answer is revealed
within your heart♪</font>

13
00:01:09,720 --> 00:01:12,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[The Legendary Chitose-Sama]</font>

14
00:01:12,040 --> 00:01:16,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Episode 40]</font>

15
00:01:20,480 --> 00:01:27,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Yaoji is a demoness]</font>

16
00:01:27,440 --> 00:01:27,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Look!</font>

17
00:01:27,960 --> 00:01:29,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Yaoji is a demoness.</font>

18
00:01:30,200 --> 00:01:30,760
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">The Moon Deity!</font>

19
00:01:30,800 --> 00:01:31,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">The Moon Deity has appeared!</font>

20
00:01:31,360 --> 00:01:32,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Yaoji is a demoness.</font>

21
00:01:32,880 --> 00:01:33,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Yaoji is a demoness.</font>

22
00:01:33,840 --> 00:01:34,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">No way.</font>

23
00:01:34,400 --> 00:01:35,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Come look! Hurry!</font>

24
00:01:35,200 --> 00:01:36,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It seems to be true.</font>

25
00:01:36,360 --> 00:01:37,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Let me see.</font>

26
00:01:37,640 --> 00:01:38,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You can't judge a book by its cover.</font>

27
00:01:39,520 --> 00:01:40,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">How can she be a demoness?</font>

28
00:01:41,160 --> 00:01:42,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I never would have guessed.</font>

29
00:01:42,440 --> 00:01:45,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Chengtian Sect]</font>

30
00:01:47,480 --> 00:01:49,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Lately, the people have been saying</font>

31
00:01:49,560 --> 00:01:51,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">that the Fourth Prince
made the statue weep,</font>

32
00:01:52,280 --> 00:01:54,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">and now a prophecy calls
the sacred maid a demoness.</font>

33
00:01:54,680 --> 00:01:56,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It's posted all over the city.</font>

34
00:01:57,360 --> 00:01:58,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Who is truly the source
of this calamity?</font>

35
00:01:59,480 --> 00:02:01,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It's all become rather confusing.</font>

36
00:02:01,800 --> 00:02:02,280
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Exactly.</font>

37
00:02:03,120 --> 00:02:04,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Since the Grandlord died,</font>

38
00:02:04,040 --> 00:02:06,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">the sacred maid has grown ever stranger.</font>

39
00:02:06,680 --> 00:02:07,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Her temper is volatile,</font>

40
00:02:08,080 --> 00:02:09,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">and she beats her maids
at the slightest whim.</font>

41
00:02:10,160 --> 00:02:10,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">What are you saying?</font>

42
00:02:12,000 --> 00:02:12,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">My Lady, forgive us!</font>

43
00:02:13,600 --> 00:02:14,120
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Guards!</font>

44
00:02:14,680 --> 00:02:15,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Drag them out for caning.</font>

45
00:02:16,160 --> 00:02:17,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">My Lady, spare us!</font>

46
00:02:17,400 --> 00:02:18,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">We know we were wrong!</font>

47
00:02:19,200 --> 00:02:20,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">My Lady, have mercy!</font>

48
00:02:20,920 --> 00:02:21,760
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Please let us go!</font>

49
00:02:21,800 --> 00:02:22,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Please spare us!</font>

50
00:02:23,160 --> 00:02:24,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">My Lady.</font>

51
00:02:34,560 --> 00:02:35,280
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">What happened here?</font>

52
00:02:35,760 --> 00:02:37,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Everyone outside calls me a demoness.</font>

53
00:02:38,360 --> 00:02:39,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Even those within the Chengtian Sect</font>

54
00:02:39,440 --> 00:02:40,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">dare to gossip about me.</font>

55
00:02:41,120 --> 00:02:42,760
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">They truly think I'm useless.</font>

56
00:02:43,440 --> 00:02:44,280
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">A bunch of ants.</font>

57
00:02:45,800 --> 00:02:46,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You needn't care</font>

58
00:02:48,200 --> 00:02:49,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">about their words at all.</font>

59
00:02:50,400 --> 00:02:51,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I am the sacred maid.</font>

60
00:02:52,680 --> 00:02:55,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">A pure messenger of the Moon Deity.</font>

61
00:02:56,920 --> 00:02:58,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">How dare they point fingers at me?</font>

62
00:03:00,000 --> 00:03:01,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It must be Qin Wei,</font>

63
00:03:02,040 --> 00:03:03,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">spreading vile rumors about me</font>

64
00:03:03,760 --> 00:03:04,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">to clear her brother's name.</font>

65
00:03:05,880 --> 00:03:06,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Where is she?</font>

66
00:03:07,120 --> 00:03:07,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Have you found her yet?</font>

67
00:03:09,040 --> 00:03:09,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I miscalculated.</font>

68
00:03:11,360 --> 00:03:13,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I underestimated her cunning.</font>

69
00:03:14,240 --> 00:03:15,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Could the Great Emperor's men</font>

70
00:03:15,360 --> 00:03:16,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">be shielding her?</font>

71
00:03:17,320 --> 00:03:18,280
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">She's hiding in the shadows,</font>

72
00:03:18,680 --> 00:03:19,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">hoping we'll panic and make mistakes.</font>

73
00:03:20,760 --> 00:03:21,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Ruling.</font>

74
00:03:21,960 --> 00:03:23,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Come with me to see the Fourth Prince.</font>

75
00:03:23,960 --> 00:03:24,760
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I refuse to believe</font>

76
00:03:25,520 --> 00:03:26,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">she can stay calm</font>

77
00:03:27,520 --> 00:03:29,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">while her brother is in our grasp.</font>

78
00:03:33,640 --> 00:03:34,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Greetings, My Lady.</font>

79
00:03:35,160 --> 00:03:36,280
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'm a convicted criminal,</font>

80
00:03:36,440 --> 00:03:37,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">so I shall not rise to greet you.</font>

81
00:03:38,080 --> 00:03:38,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Qin Mobai.</font>

82
00:03:39,040 --> 00:03:40,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Where have you hidden Qin Wei?</font>

83
00:03:42,080 --> 00:03:42,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">My sister?</font>

84
00:03:44,000 --> 00:03:45,280
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Shouldn't she be
at the Prince's Residence?</font>

85
00:03:46,240 --> 00:03:47,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Your baseless question</font>

86
00:03:48,560 --> 00:03:49,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">has left me quite confused.</font>

87
00:03:50,120 --> 00:03:50,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Stop pretending.</font>

88
00:03:51,320 --> 00:03:52,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Qin Wei, in order to save you,</font>

89
00:03:52,440 --> 00:03:53,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">infiltrated our sect</font>

90
00:03:53,360 --> 00:03:54,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">and killed our Grandlord.</font>

91
00:03:54,480 --> 00:03:55,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I don't believe
she didn't come to see you.</font>

92
00:03:57,360 --> 00:03:58,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I am here by my own choice,</font>

93
00:03:59,120 --> 00:04:00,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">praying for the people.</font>

94
00:04:00,560 --> 00:04:01,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Why would my sister need to rescue me?</font>

95
00:04:03,040 --> 00:04:03,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Even if she came,</font>

96
00:04:04,320 --> 00:04:06,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">it must be because you took her husband.</font>

97
00:04:07,360 --> 00:04:08,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">She just came to settle
the score with you.</font>

98
00:04:08,720 --> 00:04:09,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Shut your mouth.</font>

99
00:04:09,960 --> 00:04:10,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Ruling.</font>

100
00:04:12,160 --> 00:04:12,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Where is Qin Wei?</font>

101
00:04:15,160 --> 00:04:16,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You two seem so agitated.</font>

102
00:04:17,200 --> 00:04:19,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Could it be my sister found out</font>

103
00:04:20,040 --> 00:04:21,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">some secret you're desperate to hide?</font>

104
00:04:23,320 --> 00:04:24,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You are right here.</font>

105
00:04:25,040 --> 00:04:26,280
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Once we spread the word</font>

106
00:04:27,280 --> 00:04:29,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">that the sacred maid
will sacrifice the Jinx</font>

107
00:04:29,440 --> 00:04:30,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">to the Moon Deity and heal the people,</font>

108
00:04:31,640 --> 00:04:32,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">she will surely come</font>

109
00:04:33,560 --> 00:04:34,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">if she learns of it.</font>

110
00:04:34,880 --> 00:04:35,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You're setting a trap</font>

111
00:04:36,640 --> 00:04:37,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">to lure her here to her death?</font>

112
00:04:45,840 --> 00:04:46,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Ruling is right.</font>

113
00:04:47,040 --> 00:04:48,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">As long as we can capture Qin Wei,</font>

114
00:04:48,960 --> 00:04:51,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">putting on a little show means nothing.</font>

115
00:04:51,440 --> 00:04:52,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Besides,</font>

116
00:04:52,520 --> 00:04:54,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">you are the Jinx
who angered the Moon Deity.</font>

117
00:04:54,760 --> 00:04:55,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">The one who tied the knot</font>

118
00:04:56,840 --> 00:04:59,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">must be the one to untie it.</font>

119
00:05:18,680 --> 00:05:20,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">The Sect puts the people first.</font>

120
00:05:20,960 --> 00:05:23,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">We can't bear to see them suffer so.</font>

121
00:05:23,880 --> 00:05:25,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">To cure the plague in the city,</font>

122
00:05:25,800 --> 00:05:28,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">the sacred maid
will hold the rite tomorrow</font>

123
00:05:28,960 --> 00:05:30,760
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">to verify the Jinx's true identity</font>

124
00:05:30,880 --> 00:05:32,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">and perform a rite to heal the people.</font>

125
00:05:35,120 --> 00:05:35,760
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Wonderful news!</font>

126
00:05:36,840 --> 00:05:38,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Truly wonderful news!</font>

127
00:05:41,200 --> 00:05:41,760
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Listen, everyone.</font>

128
00:05:42,120 --> 00:05:43,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Once the Fourth Prince returned,</font>

129
00:05:43,440 --> 00:05:44,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">the red eye disease stuck us,</font>

130
00:05:44,960 --> 00:05:45,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">and the Moon Deity wept blood.</font>

131
00:05:45,920 --> 00:05:46,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">So, he must be the Jinx.</font>

132
00:05:47,400 --> 00:05:48,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Our sect has devoted itself</font>

133
00:05:48,880 --> 00:05:51,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">to cleansing these sins.</font>

134
00:05:52,000 --> 00:05:54,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">The Grandlord even decided
to give up his cultivation</font>

135
00:05:54,520 --> 00:05:55,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">to save the people.</font>

136
00:05:56,920 --> 00:05:57,560
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Yet</font>

137
00:05:58,000 --> 00:05:59,120
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">the Fourth Prince's sister</font>

138
00:05:59,640 --> 00:06:01,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">is a spy hidden in Beiyuan,</font>

139
00:06:02,480 --> 00:06:03,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">plotting to bring ruin to Xizhao.</font>

140
00:06:04,360 --> 00:06:06,760
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">She snuck in and killed the Grandlord</font>

141
00:06:07,680 --> 00:06:09,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">to stop him</font>

142
00:06:09,640 --> 00:06:10,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">from saving the people.</font>

143
00:06:11,560 --> 00:06:12,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It has plunged Xizhao</font>

144
00:06:13,120 --> 00:06:14,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">into misery and despair.</font>

145
00:06:15,680 --> 00:06:17,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">My cultivation is limited.</font>

146
00:06:18,320 --> 00:06:19,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'm powerless to change fate.</font>

147
00:06:19,640 --> 00:06:20,280
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Now,</font>

148
00:06:21,400 --> 00:06:23,120
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">only by sacrificing the Jinx</font>

149
00:06:23,560 --> 00:06:24,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">to the Moon Deity</font>

150
00:06:25,360 --> 00:06:27,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">can we spare the people from disaster.</font>

151
00:06:28,080 --> 00:06:29,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Kill him! Kill him!</font>

152
00:06:30,400 --> 00:06:32,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Kill him! Kill him!</font>

153
00:06:32,320 --> 00:06:32,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Guards!</font>

154
00:06:33,840 --> 00:06:35,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Bring the Jinx forward.</font>

155
00:06:35,360 --> 00:06:36,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Kill him! Kill him!</font>

156
00:06:36,600 --> 00:06:39,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Kill him! Kill him!</font>

157
00:06:40,000 --> 00:06:42,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Kill him! Kill him!</font>

158
00:06:43,000 --> 00:06:44,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Kill him! Kill him!</font>

159
00:06:49,040 --> 00:06:50,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">The sacred maid does not have
the cultivation,</font>

160
00:06:52,160 --> 00:06:52,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">but I do.</font>

161
00:06:54,840 --> 00:06:55,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">How can she...</font>

162
00:06:56,280 --> 00:06:57,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Could it be she wasn't poisoned?</font>

163
00:06:59,600 --> 00:07:00,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Even if you weren't poisoned,</font>

164
00:07:01,480 --> 00:07:02,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I won't let you leave here alive.</font>

165
00:07:03,840 --> 00:07:05,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">She's the one who killed the Grandlord!</font>

166
00:07:05,600 --> 00:07:06,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Guards! Seize her!</font>

167
00:07:07,040 --> 00:07:07,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Who dares?</font>

168
00:07:07,920 --> 00:07:08,560
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Take this!</font>

169
00:07:10,040 --> 00:07:10,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">What are you doing?</font>

170
00:07:10,640 --> 00:07:11,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Are you insane?</font>

171
00:07:11,640 --> 00:07:13,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You're the ones who are sick!</font>

172
00:07:13,040 --> 00:07:13,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You're insane!</font>

173
00:07:13,680 --> 00:07:15,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Your sickness will be cured soon.</font>

174
00:07:15,440 --> 00:07:16,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">The water splashed on you just now</font>

175
00:07:17,240 --> 00:07:18,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">is the antidote for your eyes.</font>

176
00:07:20,160 --> 00:07:21,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">The sacred maid and the Sect</font>

177
00:07:22,720 --> 00:07:24,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">have been lying to you.</font>

178
00:07:25,440 --> 00:07:26,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">The red eye disease is not a disease;</font>

179
00:07:27,280 --> 00:07:27,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">it's a poison.</font>

180
00:07:28,360 --> 00:07:29,280
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Nonsense!</font>

181
00:07:29,800 --> 00:07:32,120
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Everyone, don't believe her lies.</font>

182
00:07:32,520 --> 00:07:33,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">We'll know the truth soon enough.</font>

183
00:07:34,520 --> 00:07:35,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Those patients who were just splashed,</font>

184
00:07:36,040 --> 00:07:37,120
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">touch your own eyes.</font>

185
00:07:37,920 --> 00:07:39,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Do they feel cool</font>

186
00:07:40,040 --> 00:07:40,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">and refreshed?</font>

187
00:07:43,560 --> 00:07:44,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Much better.</font>

188
00:07:44,920 --> 00:07:45,760
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">So much better.</font>

189
00:07:46,440 --> 00:07:48,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Still spouting nonsense on death's door!</font>

190
00:07:48,760 --> 00:07:50,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Those people are with them.</font>

191
00:07:51,400 --> 00:07:53,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Seize her, now!</font>

192
00:07:53,440 --> 00:07:53,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Stop.</font>

193
00:07:56,000 --> 00:07:56,760
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You claim those few</font>

194
00:07:57,360 --> 00:07:57,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">are frauds.</font>

195
00:07:58,520 --> 00:07:59,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Is everyone here a fraud, then?</font>

196
00:08:00,680 --> 00:08:01,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Imperial Guards.</font>

197
00:08:01,520 --> 00:08:02,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Here.</font>

198
00:08:04,280 --> 00:08:05,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Listen to me, everyone.</font>

199
00:08:05,960 --> 00:08:07,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">This water is the antidote.</font>

200
00:08:08,240 --> 00:08:08,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Imperial Guards</font>

201
00:08:09,040 --> 00:08:10,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">will give out the prescription.</font>

202
00:08:10,840 --> 00:08:12,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Free medicine stalls
will open in the city.</font>

203
00:08:12,720 --> 00:08:14,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Those in need can get
the medicine themselves.</font>

204
00:08:14,800 --> 00:08:16,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">The Sect uses the people's adoration</font>

205
00:08:17,440 --> 00:08:18,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">to sow panic</font>

206
00:08:18,600 --> 00:08:19,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">and shake imperial power.</font>

207
00:08:20,320 --> 00:08:21,560
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">The death of the Grandlord</font>

208
00:08:22,280 --> 00:08:23,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">was due to internal strife.</font>

209
00:08:24,000 --> 00:08:25,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">He was killed by Yaoji.</font>

210
00:08:25,720 --> 00:08:26,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I didn't do it.</font>

211
00:08:27,160 --> 00:08:27,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I didn't.</font>

212
00:08:29,040 --> 00:08:29,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">So, it was her.</font>

213
00:08:30,720 --> 00:08:31,280
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I didn't do it.</font>

214
00:08:32,120 --> 00:08:33,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Do you have proof?</font>

215
00:08:36,440 --> 00:08:37,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I didn't.</font>

216
00:08:38,160 --> 00:08:38,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Ruling.</font>

217
00:08:40,120 --> 00:08:41,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Ruling, please speak for me.</font>

218
00:08:42,480 --> 00:08:43,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Yaoji.</font>

219
00:08:46,600 --> 00:08:47,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It's not too late to turn back.</font>

220
00:08:58,400 --> 00:08:59,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You...</font>

221
00:09:00,400 --> 00:09:01,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You...</font>

222
00:09:15,240 --> 00:09:16,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">She must be severely punished.</font>

223
00:09:20,440 --> 00:09:20,760
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Wicked woman.</font>

224
00:09:20,880 --> 00:09:21,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Mobai.</font>

225
00:09:22,360 --> 00:09:23,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Mobai, wait for me.</font>

226
00:09:23,760 --> 00:09:24,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">We can't let her off.</font>

227
00:09:24,800 --> 00:09:26,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Are you alright?</font>

228
00:09:27,080 --> 00:09:27,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'm fine.</font>

229
00:09:28,760 --> 00:09:29,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Glad you're okay.</font>

230
00:09:31,080 --> 00:09:31,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Jun,</font>

231
00:09:32,160 --> 00:09:33,120
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">are you hurt?</font>

232
00:09:33,360 --> 00:09:34,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Are you alright?</font>

233
00:09:35,480 --> 00:09:36,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You had me so worried.</font>

234
00:09:37,080 --> 00:09:37,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Let me tell you.</font>

235
00:09:37,720 --> 00:09:38,560
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">If anything had happened to you,</font>

236
00:09:38,560 --> 00:09:40,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I couldn't go on living alone.</font>

237
00:09:40,520 --> 00:09:41,560
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">She's perfectly fine.</font>

238
00:09:42,000 --> 00:09:43,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Spare me the tearful drama.</font>

239
00:09:43,680 --> 00:09:44,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Hold your tongue.</font>

240
00:09:44,760 --> 00:09:46,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Didn't you promise to protect Jun?</font>

241
00:09:46,320 --> 00:09:47,280
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Some protection that was.</font>

242
00:09:47,600 --> 00:09:48,760
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You've turned her into a murderer.</font>

243
00:09:48,880 --> 00:09:49,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Jiang Ying, am I your brother or not?</font>

244
00:09:50,080 --> 00:09:51,280
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Can you show me some concern?</font>

245
00:09:51,280 --> 00:09:52,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You don't deserve it.</font>

246
00:09:52,160 --> 00:09:52,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I do so.</font>

247
00:09:54,200 --> 00:09:55,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Qinglan, what are you looking at?</font>

248
00:09:57,280 --> 00:09:57,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Where is Li Congyao?</font>

249
00:09:58,040 --> 00:09:59,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Wasn't he just standing there?</font>

250
00:09:59,600 --> 00:10:01,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">He still has one matter left unfinished.</font>

251
00:10:01,600 --> 00:10:03,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Let's wait at the residence.</font>

252
00:10:04,160 --> 00:10:04,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Come.</font>

253
00:10:04,720 --> 00:10:05,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Let's go.</font>

254
00:10:12,560 --> 00:10:14,280
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">This medicine is truly miraculous.</font>

255
00:10:14,880 --> 00:10:16,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It healed Jun's eyes so quickly.</font>

256
00:10:17,240 --> 00:10:18,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You have no idea.</font>

257
00:10:18,360 --> 00:10:19,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">When I learned you were poisoned,</font>

258
00:10:19,920 --> 00:10:20,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I was worried sick.</font>

259
00:10:21,040 --> 00:10:22,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">We must thank my brother-in-law.</font>

260
00:10:23,080 --> 00:10:24,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">He found the incomplete prescription.</font>

261
00:10:25,760 --> 00:10:26,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Otherwise,</font>

262
00:10:26,640 --> 00:10:27,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">not only would Wei's poison persist,</font>

263
00:10:28,480 --> 00:10:29,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">but the rainmaking to save the people</font>

264
00:10:29,760 --> 00:10:30,760
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">would also fail.</font>

265
00:10:31,120 --> 00:10:31,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Don't thank me.</font>

266
00:10:32,320 --> 00:10:33,560
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It has little to do with me.</font>

267
00:10:33,920 --> 00:10:35,120
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">This is the real heroine.</font>

268
00:10:35,840 --> 00:10:36,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Right here.</font>

269
00:10:38,240 --> 00:10:39,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Leave Qinglan to me.</font>

270
00:10:40,360 --> 00:10:40,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Leave the prescription</font>

271
00:10:41,560 --> 00:10:42,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">to me as well.</font>

272
00:10:43,880 --> 00:10:44,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Go, now.</font>

273
00:10:46,920 --> 00:10:47,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Hurry.</font>

274
00:10:58,280 --> 00:10:58,760
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I must test</font>

275
00:10:59,360 --> 00:11:00,280
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">the medicine myself.</font>

276
00:11:02,000 --> 00:11:02,760
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I recall</font>

277
00:11:02,840 --> 00:11:04,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">a medical text once stated</font>

278
00:11:06,000 --> 00:11:07,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">that medicines have yin-yang pairings.</font>

279
00:11:08,360 --> 00:11:09,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Some act alone,</font>

280
00:11:09,840 --> 00:11:10,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">some reinforce,</font>

281
00:11:11,040 --> 00:11:11,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">some assist,</font>

282
00:11:11,960 --> 00:11:12,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">some oppose,</font>

283
00:11:13,120 --> 00:11:13,760
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">some restrain,</font>

284
00:11:13,760 --> 00:11:14,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">some counteract, and some clash.</font>

285
00:11:16,080 --> 00:11:17,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Those relations must be considered</font>

286
00:11:17,480 --> 00:11:18,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">and observed.</font>

287
00:11:18,560 --> 00:11:19,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">What does it mean?</font>

288
00:11:20,080 --> 00:11:21,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">The formula is missing one ingredient.</font>

289
00:11:22,080 --> 00:11:23,280
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">We'll have to test</font>

290
00:11:23,400 --> 00:11:24,120
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">dozens of combinations.</font>

291
00:11:24,440 --> 00:11:25,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Dozens?</font>

292
00:11:26,400 --> 00:11:27,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Can your eyes endure that?</font>

293
00:11:29,840 --> 00:11:30,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'll be fine.</font>

294
00:11:31,080 --> 00:11:31,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Let's begin.</font>

295
00:11:42,960 --> 00:11:43,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Qinglan,</font>

296
00:11:44,120 --> 00:11:45,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I've already given the antidote</font>

297
00:11:45,600 --> 00:11:46,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">and prescription to Li Congyao.</font>

298
00:11:47,280 --> 00:11:48,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">How are things on his end?</font>

299
00:11:48,840 --> 00:11:49,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Does he have a plan for the next step?</font>

300
00:11:50,960 --> 00:11:52,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Since you're so worried,</font>

301
00:11:52,280 --> 00:11:53,120
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">why insist I come?</font>

302
00:11:53,360 --> 00:11:54,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Out with it.</font>

303
00:11:54,520 --> 00:11:55,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Rest easy.</font>

304
00:11:55,360 --> 00:11:56,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Li Congyao is fine.</font>

305
00:11:56,800 --> 00:11:57,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">He's about to carry out</font>

306
00:11:57,680 --> 00:11:59,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">the plan to bring down the Sect.</font>

307
00:11:59,640 --> 00:12:00,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Mobai,</font>

308
00:12:00,880 --> 00:12:02,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">you and Li Congyao planned</font>

309
00:12:03,320 --> 00:12:05,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">to lure Yaoji
into holding the rite, right?</font>

310
00:12:07,520 --> 00:12:07,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Poisoned?</font>

311
00:12:08,480 --> 00:12:09,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">How could Wei be poisoned?</font>

312
00:12:10,080 --> 00:12:11,280
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">She snuck into Yaoji's room</font>

313
00:12:11,680 --> 00:12:12,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">and knocked over the poison.</font>

314
00:12:13,600 --> 00:12:15,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">She witnessed Yaoji kill the Grandlord.</font>

315
00:12:17,160 --> 00:12:18,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Yaoji pinned the crime</font>

316
00:12:18,000 --> 00:12:19,280
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">entirely on Wei.</font>

317
00:12:19,760 --> 00:12:21,280
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Now, Wei is being hunted by pursuers.</font>

318
00:12:23,840 --> 00:12:24,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Li Congyao.</font>

319
00:12:24,720 --> 00:12:25,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Look what you've done.</font>

320
00:12:25,920 --> 00:12:27,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You've regained your memory.</font>

321
00:12:27,280 --> 00:12:28,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I told you long ago not to stay here.</font>

322
00:12:28,600 --> 00:12:29,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">But you wouldn't listen.</font>

323
00:12:29,880 --> 00:12:30,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You talked about crushing her spirit,</font>

324
00:12:31,120 --> 00:12:32,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">wanting to stay and torment Yaoji.</font>

325
00:12:32,880 --> 00:12:33,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">And now, look what's happened.</font>

326
00:12:33,840 --> 00:12:34,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Even Wei has been dragged into this.</font>

327
00:12:35,600 --> 00:12:36,560
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">The Grandlord is dead.</font>

328
00:12:37,480 --> 00:12:38,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Yaoji has no antidote.</font>

329
00:12:39,880 --> 00:12:41,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">There is no cure
for the red eye disease.</font>

330
00:12:42,720 --> 00:12:44,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">And now, Wei is trapped as well.</font>

331
00:12:46,560 --> 00:12:47,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">This is not the time for our quarrels.</font>

332
00:12:51,360 --> 00:12:52,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I came here and prepared to die</font>

333
00:12:52,680 --> 00:12:54,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">just to bargain for the cure.</font>

334
00:12:55,120 --> 00:12:55,760
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It's clear to me now</font>

335
00:12:56,320 --> 00:12:56,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">that constant yielding</font>

336
00:12:57,480 --> 00:12:58,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">only invites more harm.</font>

337
00:12:58,720 --> 00:12:59,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Not necessarily.</font>

338
00:13:00,480 --> 00:13:01,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">We may be surrounded by enemies,</font>

339
00:13:02,640 --> 00:13:04,280
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">but the Sect is now leaderless.</font>

340
00:13:05,320 --> 00:13:06,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">The situation is hardly in their favor.</font>

341
00:13:07,480 --> 00:13:08,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You mean...</font>

342
00:13:09,280 --> 00:13:10,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Yaoji bewitched me back then,</font>

343
00:13:11,640 --> 00:13:12,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">so I decided to pay her back</font>

344
00:13:14,440 --> 00:13:15,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">in her own coin.</font>

345
00:13:19,240 --> 00:13:20,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">He and I worked in tandem,</font>

346
00:13:20,480 --> 00:13:21,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">putting on a play together</font>

347
00:13:21,960 --> 00:13:23,120
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">to lure Yaoji into drawing you out.</font>

348
00:13:23,720 --> 00:13:25,280
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">The goal was to make her
hold the ceremony.</font>

349
00:13:25,680 --> 00:13:26,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">At the assembly,</font>

350
00:13:26,920 --> 00:13:28,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">we would expose the Sect's true colors.</font>

351
00:13:28,360 --> 00:13:29,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">But</font>

352
00:13:29,400 --> 00:13:30,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">what if we had no antidote?</font>

353
00:13:31,880 --> 00:13:32,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">We didn't have it,</font>

354
00:13:32,920 --> 00:13:33,760
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">and neither did Yaoji.</font>

355
00:13:34,400 --> 00:13:35,280
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Once you enter the game,</font>

356
00:13:35,560 --> 00:13:36,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">the outcome is already sealed.</font>

357
00:13:40,880 --> 00:13:41,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Ying,</font>

358
00:13:42,120 --> 00:13:43,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">have you hidden anything from me?</font>

359
00:13:44,000 --> 00:13:45,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I...</font>

360
00:13:45,360 --> 00:13:46,760
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I just</font>

361
00:13:47,200 --> 00:13:48,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">made a prophecy come out.</font>

362
00:13:50,000 --> 00:13:50,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">That demoness!</font>

363
00:13:51,000 --> 00:13:51,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'm furious!</font>

364
00:13:51,920 --> 00:13:53,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'll never forgive you.</font>

365
00:14:02,440 --> 00:14:03,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Li Congyao!</font>

366
00:14:03,400 --> 00:14:04,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You dare show your face here?</font>

367
00:14:04,840 --> 00:14:06,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'll smash your head in.</font>

368
00:14:08,880 --> 00:14:10,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Do you still want to save Qin Mobai?</font>

369
00:14:15,320 --> 00:14:16,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">This is green vitriol oil.</font>

370
00:14:17,000 --> 00:14:17,760
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Once exposed to light,</font>

371
00:14:17,880 --> 00:14:18,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">it will slowly reveal its color.</font>

372
00:14:20,080 --> 00:14:21,120
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">We'll use their own methods</font>

373
00:14:22,000 --> 00:14:23,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">against them.</font>

374
00:14:30,240 --> 00:14:31,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Yaoji is a demoness.</font>

375
00:14:32,120 --> 00:14:33,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">So, it was your doing.</font>

376
00:14:36,120 --> 00:14:36,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I never imagined</font>

377
00:14:36,960 --> 00:14:38,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">you'd all be so formidable.</font>

378
00:14:39,280 --> 00:14:41,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">To orchestrate such an elaborate scheme.</font>

379
00:14:44,360 --> 00:14:45,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">This is nothing.</font>

380
00:14:45,640 --> 00:14:47,120
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You've worked even harder.</font>

381
00:14:47,480 --> 00:14:48,560
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You've found the antidote.</font>

382
00:14:54,840 --> 00:14:56,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Li Congyao is truly something.</font>

383
00:14:57,280 --> 00:14:58,560
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">To think he could turn my brother</font>

384
00:14:58,880 --> 00:15:00,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">and my closest friends</font>

385
00:15:00,280 --> 00:15:01,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">to his side.</font>

386
00:15:02,560 --> 00:15:03,560
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">If I hadn't overheard</font>

387
00:15:03,560 --> 00:15:04,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">his conversation with the Chief,</font>

388
00:15:04,920 --> 00:15:06,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'd still be completely in the dark.</font>

389
00:15:08,000 --> 00:15:08,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Your Highness,</font>

390
00:15:08,640 --> 00:15:09,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">the sacred maid has been taken.</font>

391
00:15:11,320 --> 00:15:11,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Mobai?</font>

392
00:15:13,480 --> 00:15:14,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I...</font>

393
00:15:33,920 --> 00:15:34,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Ruling,</font>

394
00:15:35,320 --> 00:15:36,280
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">you came to save me.</font>

395
00:15:47,080 --> 00:15:48,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">This stab is for Wei.</font>

396
00:15:49,720 --> 00:15:50,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I once swore to myself</font>

397
00:15:52,320 --> 00:15:53,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">that for what you did to Wei,</font>

398
00:15:55,000 --> 00:15:56,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I would make you pay tenfold.</font>

399
00:15:59,040 --> 00:16:00,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">This is just the first stab.</font>

400
00:16:01,680 --> 00:16:02,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">And now,</font>

401
00:16:03,440 --> 00:16:04,560
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">nine more stabs to go.</font>

402
00:16:07,160 --> 00:16:07,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Li Congyao.</font>

403
00:16:11,920 --> 00:16:12,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">What are you standing there for?</font>

404
00:16:13,160 --> 00:16:14,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Come back with me now.</font>

405
00:16:15,520 --> 00:16:16,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">The husband obeys the wife.</font>

406
00:16:17,360 --> 00:16:18,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">My wife has spoken,</font>

407
00:16:19,440 --> 00:16:20,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">so I dare not disobey.</font>

408
00:16:28,720 --> 00:16:29,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You've become far too unruly.</font>

409
00:16:30,480 --> 00:16:31,760
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Just wait till I get you home.</font>

410
00:16:31,760 --> 00:16:32,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'm sorry.</font>

411
00:16:32,680 --> 00:16:33,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Please don't be angry.</font>

412
00:16:38,440 --> 00:16:39,560
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Prince's Residence]
Please relay a message for me.</font>

413
00:16:40,080 --> 00:16:41,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Once I settle matters with the Sect,</font>

414
00:16:41,720 --> 00:16:43,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'll return to the Palace to see Father.</font>

415
00:16:44,120 --> 00:16:45,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I will certainly inform
the Great Emperor</font>

416
00:16:45,920 --> 00:16:47,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">of your filial devotion.</font>

417
00:16:48,120 --> 00:16:48,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Your Highness, please stay.</font>

418
00:16:55,760 --> 00:16:57,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">What will the Great Emperor do
with Yaoji?</font>

419
00:16:58,000 --> 00:16:59,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">The Sect has fallen apart.</font>

420
00:17:00,280 --> 00:17:01,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">The Great Emperor had me
absorb the remaining guards.</font>

421
00:17:02,480 --> 00:17:03,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Though the Grandlord is dead,</font>

422
00:17:03,520 --> 00:17:04,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Yaoji, as the sacred maid,</font>

423
00:17:04,760 --> 00:17:05,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">is implicated in the conspiracy.</font>

424
00:17:05,880 --> 00:17:06,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">She shall be executed at the Zi hour.</font>

425
00:17:08,640 --> 00:17:09,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Hey, you two!</font>

426
00:17:09,400 --> 00:17:10,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Have you both caught
the red eye disease?</font>

427
00:17:11,040 --> 00:17:11,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'm carrying all this stuff.</font>

428
00:17:11,920 --> 00:17:13,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Can you lend me a hand?</font>

429
00:17:15,120 --> 00:17:17,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">How could we trouble the Fourth Prince</font>

430
00:17:17,960 --> 00:17:19,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">and Lord Ruling with such menial tasks?</font>

431
00:17:19,440 --> 00:17:19,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Right?</font>

432
00:17:20,120 --> 00:17:21,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Exactly, exactly.</font>

433
00:17:21,960 --> 00:17:22,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Listen here, Jiang Yufan.</font>

434
00:17:24,000 --> 00:17:26,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Didn't you say that, to make amends,</font>

435
00:17:26,000 --> 00:17:27,280
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">you'd properly show us</font>

436
00:17:27,280 --> 00:17:28,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">around Tianzhao City?</font>

437
00:17:29,040 --> 00:17:30,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Are you regretting it
after just one day?</font>

438
00:17:31,280 --> 00:17:32,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You big liar.</font>

439
00:17:33,840 --> 00:17:35,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I keep my promises</font>

440
00:17:35,000 --> 00:17:36,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">no matter what.</font>

441
00:17:36,800 --> 00:17:37,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">To make it up to you both,</font>

442
00:17:38,040 --> 00:17:38,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">tomorrow, we'll continue,</font>

443
00:17:39,360 --> 00:17:40,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">and we'll stroll the city</font>

444
00:17:40,560 --> 00:17:41,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">inside out.</font>

445
00:17:43,160 --> 00:17:44,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">That's more like it.</font>

446
00:17:44,840 --> 00:17:45,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Let's go.</font>

447
00:17:48,080 --> 00:17:48,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Ying.</font>

448
00:17:48,360 --> 00:17:48,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Wei.</font>

449
00:17:49,720 --> 00:17:50,280
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Mobai.</font>

450
00:17:52,160 --> 00:17:52,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Ying.</font>

451
00:17:53,200 --> 00:17:55,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">A woman without resolve
won't hold her place.</font>

452
00:17:55,760 --> 00:17:56,560
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Think it through carefully.</font>

453
00:18:12,140 --> 00:18:14,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪We'll see all the world's sights♪</font>

454
00:18:15,010 --> 00:18:16,390
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪Drifting with the clouds♪</font>

455
00:18:16,680 --> 00:18:19,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪Leave our names etched
in each other's hearts♪</font>

456
00:18:20,600 --> 00:18:24,930
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪Bright as a goddess, stirring my soul♪</font>

457
00:18:25,280 --> 00:18:28,580
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪Each stroke inscribed
into the passing years♪</font>

458
00:18:29,270 --> 00:18:33,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪A sky full of stars covers
the peach blossom spring♪</font>

459
00:18:33,790 --> 00:18:38,060
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪With you, hand in hand
across the vast world♪</font>

460
00:18:38,120 --> 00:18:43,770
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪No words needed,
our hearts mirror each other♪</font>

461
00:18:46,260 --> 00:18:50,560
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪Catching a teardrop on my fingertip♪</font>

462
00:18:50,930 --> 00:18:54,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪Then gently caressing your face♪</font>

463
00:18:54,980 --> 00:18:59,310
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪We await mercy
as the rain flutters down♪</font>

464
00:18:59,520 --> 00:19:02,510
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪This floating life
is like a myriad of dreams♪</font>

465
00:19:03,500 --> 00:19:07,690
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪No matter how far the journey,
our passion endures♪</font>

466
00:19:08,100 --> 00:19:11,870
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪Let's turn a blind eye
to all the gossip and rumors♪</font>
